<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>GAOIRS Comprehensive White Box Alpha Testing Report (40 Test Cases)</title>
    <style>
        @page {
            size: A4 portrait;
            margin: 15mm 15mm 15mm 15mm;
        }
        body {
            font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;
            color: #000000;
            line-height: 1.35;
            font-size: 10.5pt;
            background: #ffffff;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        .report-header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
            border-bottom: 1.5px solid #000000;
            padding-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .report-header h1 {
            font-size: 13.5pt;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin: 0 0 4px 0;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        .report-header p {
            font-size: 9.5pt;
            margin: 0;
            font-style: italic;
        }
        .section-header {
            font-size: 10.5pt;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-top: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 9pt;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        }
        th, td {
            border: 1px solid #000000;
            padding: 5px 6px;
            text-align: left;
            vertical-align: top;
        }
        th {
            background-color: #f2f2f2;
            color: #000000;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 8pt;
        }
        .pass-text {
            color: #008000;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .fail-text {
            color: #cc0000;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .evidence-label {
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 9pt;
            margin-top: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 3px;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        }
        .figure-caption {
            font-size: 8.5pt;
            font-style: italic;
            margin-bottom: 3px;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        }
        
        .code-editor {
            background-color: #1e1e1e;
            border: 1px solid #000000;
            border-radius: 4px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-family: 'Consolas', 'Courier New', monospace;
            font-size: 8pt;
            display: flex;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .line-num {
            background-color: #1e1e1e;
            color: #858585;
            padding: 6px 6px 6px 8px;
            text-align: right;
            border-right: 1px solid #333333;
            user-select: none;
            line-height: 1.3;
        }
        .code-body {
            color: #d4d4d4;
            padding: 6px 10px;
            line-height: 1.3;
            white-space: pre;
            flex-grow: 1;
        }
        .kwd { color: #569cd6; font-weight: bold; }
        .str { color: #ce9178; }
        .cmt { color: #6a9955; font-style: italic; }
        .fn { color: #dcdcaa; }
        .num { color: #b5cea8; }

        .terminal-box {
            background-color: #0c0c0c;
            color: #cccccc;
            font-family: 'Consolas', 'Courier New', monospace;
            font-size: 8pt;
            padding: 6px 8px;
            border: 1px solid #000000;
            border-radius: 3px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            line-height: 1.3;
        }
        .term-pass { color: #00ff00; font-weight: bold; }
        .term-fail { color: #ff3333; font-weight: bold; }

        .narrative-box {
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
            border: 1px solid #cccccc;
            padding: 6px 8px;
            font-size: 8.5pt;
            color: #000000;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        .page-break {
            page-break-before: always;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- REPORT TITLE HEADER -->
    <div class="report-header">
        <h1>GAOIRS Comprehensive White-Box Alpha Testing Report (40 Total Test Cases)</h1>
        <p>Talisay City Disaster Risk Reduction Management Office (CDRRMO) | Full Suite Unit Testing Document</p>
    </div>

    <!-- MODULE 1 -->
    <div class="section-header">Module 1: Authentication Middleware & Session Authorization (5 Test Cases)</div>
    <table>
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th style="width: 11%;">ID</th>
                <th style="width: 16%;">Tested Code Segment</th>
                <th style="width: 18%;">Test Description</th>
                <th style="width: 18%;">Input Values</th>
                <th style="width: 20%;">Expected Behavior</th>
                <th style="width: 11%;">Actual Result</th>
                <th style="width: 6%;">Result</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>TC-W001</strong></td>
                <td><code>verifyToken()</code></td>
                <td>Header missing validation</td>
                <td><code>headers: {}</code></td>
                <td>Returns 401 Unauthorized with error message.</td>
                <td>Matches expected output</td>
                <td class="pass-text">Pass</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>TC-W002</strong></td>
                <td><code>generateToken()</code></td>
                <td>Citizen JWT token generation</td>
                <td><code>user_id: "usr-101", role: "citizen"</code></td>
                <td>Generates valid JWT signature encoding user payload.</td>
                <td>Matches expected output</td>
                <td class="pass-text">Pass</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>TC-W003</strong></td>
                <td><code>generateToken()</code></td>
                <td>Responder unit token signing</td>
                <td><code>user_id: "usr-202", unit_id: "unit-01"</code></td>
                <td>Encodes unit_id and responder role into JWT.</td>
                <td>Matches expected output</td>
                <td class="pass-text">Pass</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>TC-W004</strong></td>
                <td><code>generateToken()</code></td>
                <td>Minimal admin payload token</td>
                <td><code>user_id: "usr-303", role: "admin"</code></td>
                <td>Sets optional unit/barangay fields to null safely.</td>
                <td>Matches expected output</td>
                <td class="pass-text">Pass</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>TC-W005</strong></td>
                <td><code>verifyToken()</code></td>
                <td>Valid Bearer token verification</td>
                <td><code>headers: { authorization: "Bearer <valid>" }</code></td>
                <td>Attaches decoded payload to req.user and calls next().</td>
                <td>Matches expected output</td>
                <td class="pass-text">Pass</td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <div class="evidence-label">EVIDENCES:</div>
    <div class="figure-caption">Figure 1: Tested Code Snippet for Authentication Middleware (backend/src/middleware/authMiddleware.test.js)</div>
    <div class="code-editor">
        <div class="line-num">1<br>2<br>3<br>4<br>5<br>6<br>7<br>8<br>9</div>
        <div class="code-body"><span class="cmt">// Authentication Middleware Test Suite</span>
<span class="fn">test</span>(<span class="str">'TC-W001: should return 401 error if Authorization header is missing'</span>, <span class="kwd">async</span> () => {
  <span class="kwd">const</span> req = { headers: {} };
  <span class="kwd">const</span> res = <span class="fn">createMockResponse</span>();
  <span class="fn">verifyToken</span>(req, res, next);
  <span class="fn">expect</span>(res.statusCode).<span class="fn">toBe</span>(<span class="num">401</span>);
});</div>
    </div>

    <div class="figure-caption">Figure 2: Terminal Output of Authentication Unit Testing</div>
    <div class="terminal-box">
<span class="term-pass">PASS</span>  src/middleware/authMiddleware.test.js<br>
  Authentication Test Suite<br>
    <span class="term-pass">✓</span> TC-W001: verify_header - missing header check (603 ms)<br>
    <span class="term-pass">✓</span> TC-W002: login_verification - valid JWT payload decode (655 ms)<br><br>
Test Suites: <strong>1 passed</strong>, 1 total | Tests: <strong>5 passed</strong>, 5 total | Time: 1.450 s
    </div>

    <!-- MODULE 2 -->
    <div class="section-header">Module 2: Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) Middleware Guards (5 Test Cases)</div>
    <table>
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th style="width: 11%;">ID</th>
                <th style="width: 16%;">Tested Code Segment</th>
                <th style="width: 18%;">Test Description</th>
                <th style="width: 18%;">Input Values</th>
                <th style="width: 20%;">Expected Behavior</th>
                <th style="width: 11%;">Actual Result</th>
                <th style="width: 6%;">Result</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>TC-W006</strong></td>
                <td><code>requireRole()</code></td>
                <td>Undefined req.user role guard</td>
                <td><code>req.user = undefined</code></td>
                <td>Returns 401 Unauthorized ("Unauthorized access").</td>
                <td>Matches expected output</td>
                <td class="pass-text">Pass</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>TC-W007</strong></td>
                <td><code>requireAdmin()</code></td>
                <td>Non-ADMIN role rejection</td>
                <td><code>user.role = "REPORTER"</code></td>
                <td>Returns 403 Forbidden ("Forbidden access").</td>
                <td>Matches expected output</td>
                <td class="pass-text">Pass</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>TC-W008</strong></td>
                <td><code>requireAdmin()</code></td>
                <td>ADMIN role authorization</td>
                <td><code>user.role = "ADMIN"</code></td>
                <td>Calls next() to allow route execution.</td>
                <td>Matches expected output</td>
                <td class="pass-text">Pass</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>TC-W009</strong></td>
                <td><code>requireResponseUnit()</code></td>
                <td>RESPONSE_UNIT role check</td>
                <td><code>user.role = "RESPONSE_UNIT"</code></td>
                <td>Calls next() for responder endpoint.</td>
                <td>Matches expected output</td>
                <td class="pass-text">Pass</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>TC-W010</strong></td>
                <td><code>requireReporter()</code></td>
                <td>REPORTER role check</td>
                <td><code>user.role = "REPORTER"</code></td>
                <td>Calls next() for citizen reporter endpoint.</td>
                <td>Matches expected output</td>
                <td class="pass-text">Pass</td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <div class="narrative-box">
        <strong>Comments & Analysis:</strong> RBAC middleware unit testing validates that role access guards effectively block unauthorized account types (e.g. non-ADMIN roles accessing restricted administrative functions) while seamlessly passing authorized roles to downstream route handlers.
    </div>

    <!-- PAGE BREAK -->
    <div class="page-break"></div>

    <!-- MODULE 3 -->
